## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Separate Coumarin crystal, Hay Absolute basis/composite coverage, and exact Exaltolide texture remain gaps. Do not use the ambiguous saturated Coumarin stock. For a later role-isolation control, prepare Coumarin 10% w/w by weighing 1.000 g owned neat Coumarin plus 9.000 g TEC, record the receipt, and verify it before dosing; no dissolution or stability claim is made. Do not add Hay yet. Verify EB and keep every tincture excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-07 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Only after preparation verification, add a carrier-matched pure-Coumarin role control. Judge dry hay-skin character, cardamom-lavender retention, dessert/powder drift, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

